# Private collector credential. Copy to a private file (chmod 600), set the value locally
# and pass the file before the subcommand:
#   academy-collector --env-file .env run --live --daily
# Only this one literal assignment is read, and it overrides any ambient key.
# No other lines, variable expansion, shell execution, base URL, organization or project overrides.
# academy-api never loads this file or requires a key.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# The settings below are read from the collector's process environment (for example a
# launchd or systemd job definition), never from this file. All are optional.
# ACADEMY_SNAPSHOT_PATH=/srv/academy/snapshot.json
# ACADEMY_COLLECTOR_STATE=/srv/academy/collector
# Cloudflare purge of one hostname after a changed publication. Set all three or none:
# ACADEMY_CLOUDFLARE_ZONE_ID=0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef
# ACADEMY_CLOUDFLARE_HOSTNAME=api.example.com
# ACADEMY_CLOUDFLARE_PURGE_TOKEN_FILE=/srv/academy/cache-purge-token
